Functional diff from 5dc3d3c to current worktree

Files changed or added
.gitignore: now ignores zip files and harness/bin, and uses a final-results exception scheme for benchmark/results/final CSV/JSON/MD while keeping raw outputs ignored.
benchmark/summarize.py: modified in the worktree before this pass; left unstaged and not audited as part of this pass.
benchmark/sweep_rate.sh: modified in the worktree before this pass; left unstaged and not audited as part of this pass.
harness/include/dedupe_window.h: new sliding-window receiver dedupe implementation and counters.
harness/include/fec.h: new XOR FEC encoder/decoder, envelope format, and recovery counters.
harness/src/receiver.cpp: adds FEC envelope decoding, sliding-window dedupe by default, --dedupe-disable compatibility path, dedupe/FEC counters, and keeps recvmmsg batching.
harness/src/sender.cpp: adds seeded impairment injector, optional FEC envelope/parity, FEC timeout and counters, restored sendmmsg batching, and restored --batch-size/--batch-timeout-us defaults.
harness/test/test_harness.cpp: adds dedupe and FEC unit tests, including raw no-FEC stream, duplicate suppression, delayed delivery, single-loss recovery, multi-loss unrecoverable, and out-of-order FEC recovery.
reports/offline_de/*: offline audit and correctness evidence logs from prior pass.
reports/fix_pass/*: fix and readiness logs plus small diagnostic logs.

